{"id":"word:hebrew:H7998","type":"word","title":"שָׁלָל","subtitle":"H7998 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"booty","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to שָׁלָל (H7998) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 74 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"שָׁלָל (shâlâl) means booty First listed occurrence: 1Chr 20 2."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"שָׁלָל","transliteration":"shâlâl","pronunciation":"shaw-lawl'","strong":"H7998","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7998","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["הַ/שָּׁלָ֖ל","שָׁלָֽל","וּ/שְׁלַ֥ל","הַ/שָּׁלָ֔ל","שָׁלָ֖ל"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",19],["HTd/Ncmsa",10],["HNcmsc",7],["HR/Ncmsa",7],["HNcmsc/Sp3fs",6],["HC/Ncmsc",5],["HR/Td/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmsc/Sp3mp",3],["HC/Ncmsa",3],["HR/Ncmsc",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"booty","usage":"prey, spoil.","full":"H7998. shalal שָׁלָל 75 noun masculine 1Sam 30:16 prey, spoil, plunder, booty ; — absolute ׳שׁ Gen 49:27 +; construct שְׁלַל Judg 5:30 +, suffix שְׁלָלֵךְ Zech 14:1 , שְׁלַלְכֶם Isa 33:4 , etc.; &#8212; 1 prey , of Benjamin as wolf Gen 49:27 (poem in J; with חִלֵּק ). 2 booty, spoil of war, of all kinds (often || בַּז ): including garments, gold and silver Josh 7:21 (J), ornaments Judg 8:24-25 , fabrics and women 5:30 a, b, flocks and herds 1Sam 30:20 ; Jer 49:32 ; 2Chr 15:11 , + persons Deut 20:14 (twice in verse), garments, food and drink 2Chr 28:15 , etc. (58 t.; among these) הֶעָרִים שְׁלַל Deut 2:25 ; 2Sam 12:30 ; 1Chr 20:2 and (+ cattle in addition) Deut 3:7 ; Josh 8:27 ; 11:14 (both R D ), compare (also of city) Isa 8:4 ; Deut 13:17 (twice in verse); Zech 14:1 and (+ cattle) Josh 8:2 (R D ), but including person and cattle Deut 20:14 , compare 20:14 ; figurative of entire nation Jer 50:10 ; Ezek 7:21 ; Zech 2:13 ; ׳שׁ in symbolic proper name וגו שָׁלָל ׳מַהֵר Isa 8:1 , 3 , see above p.555:a; ׳שׁ in metaphor of future majesty of י ׳עֶבֶד 53:12 ; לְשׁ נַפְשׁוֺ ׳וְהֳיְתָהאלּוֺ i.e. life shall be spared, Jer 21:9 ; 38:2 ; 39:18 , compare 45:5 . 3 private plunder Isa 10:2 ( שְׁלָלָם אַלְמָנוֺת ), Prov 1:13 and (perhaps in current saying) 16:19 . 4 = gain Prov 31:11 . &#8212; שׁ ׳לְצַוִּארֵי Judg 5:30 c is clearly wrong; meaning dubious (see especially GFM); plausible conjectures are שׁ ׳לְצַוָּארַי for my neck as spoil , Reuss Br and others, and שֵׁגָל לְצַוְּארֵי for the neck of the queen Ew Be Kit and others (but שֵׁגָל elsewhere late); Now strike out שָׁלָל and reads לְצַוָּארָיו .","rootNote":"from 7997 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 20 2","keyReferences":["1Chr 20 2","1Chr 26 27","1Sam 14 30","1Sam 14 32","1Sam 14 32","1Sam 15 19","1Sam 15 21","1Sam 30 16"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":74,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 20 2","book":"1Chr","chapter":20,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁלַ֥ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 27","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":27,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שָּׁלָ֖ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 14 30","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/שְּׁלַ֥ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 14 32","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שלל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 14 32","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שָּׁלָ֔ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 15 19","book":"1Sam","chapter":15,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שָּׁלָ֔ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 15 21","book":"1Sam","chapter":15,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵ/הַ/שָּׁלָ֛ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Td/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 30 16","book":"1Sam","chapter":30,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שׁ